1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,100
If you run a plumbing or heating business, how many missed calls never got a call back?

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,494
Here's a sample list for an invented plumbing company.

3
00:00:08,744 --> 00:00:14,440
Twelve missed calls and four web inquiries became seven open leads, ranked by urgency.

4
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:18,431
A message that mentions a gas smell gets no written draft.

5
00:00:18,681 --> 00:00:21,583
It goes to the top, for a person to call back now.

6
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:27,451
Every other open lead gets a draft reply, written for you to review and send yourself.

7
00:00:27,701 --> 00:00:30,240
Amber never calls or texts your customers.

